{
  "uid": "pedidos",
  "title": "Pedidos",
  "description": "Tres perguntas numa tela: o sistema esta com erro? esta lento? o dinheiro esta entrando?",
  "tags": [
    "desafio",
    "observabilidade"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "editable": true,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Erro: % de cobrancas com falha (SLI) e % de respostas HTTP 5xx",
      "description": "Responde: o sistema esta com erro? A linha tracejada e o limiar do alerta FalhaEmCobrancas (14.4%, burn rate 14.4 sobre SLO de 99%). HTTP 5xx cobre a api; falha de cobranca cobre o worker, que o cliente nao enxerga.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(cobrancas_processadas_total{resultado=\"falha\"}[1m])) / sum(rate(cobrancas_processadas_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "cobrancas com falha",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"api\",status=~\"5..\"}[1m])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"api\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "respostas HTTP 5xx",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "vector(14.4 * (1 - 0.99))",
          "legendFormat": "limiar do alerta (14.4%)",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "cobrancas com falha"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "respostas HTTP 5xx"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "limiar do alerta (14.4%)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "fill": "dash",
                  "dash": [
                    10,
                    10
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.fillOpacity",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Lentidao: latencia p95 das rotas da api",
      "description": "Responde: o sistema esta lento? Percentil 95 do histograma http_request_duration_seconds, por rota template.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, route) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"api\", route!~\"/metrics|/health\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Dinheiro: cobrancas por resultado (por minuto)",
      "description": "Responde: o dinheiro esta entrando? Aprovada e dinheiro que entrou; recusada e negativa legitima do processador; falha e cobranca que nao aconteceu.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (resultado) (rate(cobrancas_processadas_total[1m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{resultado}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "aprovada"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "recusada"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "yellow"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "falha"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Dinheiro: pedidos confirmados x cobrancas aprovadas (por minuto)",
      "description": "Responde: o dinheiro esta entrando? Todo pedido confirmado deveria ter uma cobranca aprovada. A diferenca sao pedidos confirmados ao cliente sem que o dinheiro tenha entrado; o normal e zero.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(pedidos_confirmados_total[1m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "pedidos confirmados",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(cobrancas_processadas_total{resultado=\"aprovada\"}[1m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "cobrancas aprovadas",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(pedidos_confirmados_total[1m])) - sum(rate(cobrancas_processadas_total{resultado=\"aprovada\"}[1m]))) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "confirmados sem cobranca",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "pedidos confirmados"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "cobrancas aprovadas"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "confirmados sem cobranca"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
